  "limitations": [
    "Fourteen owned registrar 0x19b24 callbacks remain inventory-only because they alter attestation, authentication enforcement or permission reporting.",
    "Initializer 0x151a0 decision and installation routing is not implemented. This module exposes only an explicit local installer and has no constructor.",
    "The four YTIIosPlayerConfig records in registrar 0x19b24 are owned by Configuration and are not implemented here. No security activation predicate is supplied.",
    "The optional remoteViewControllerWillDismiss: dispatch uses performSelector: without an argument, matching the package. The missing argument and the host response to it are unspecified.",
    "Runtime verification replaces the existing InitWorkaround and bundle installer with boundary fixtures; their production implementations are reused, not reimplemented.",
    "Obfuscation, string-decode bookkeeping, and protection syscalls are not reproduced."
  ]
